<title>USA: Chittenden sets buyback up to 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Chittenden sets buyback up to 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chittenden Corp said on Thursday that it would repurchase up to one million shares of its common stock over a two-year period.</p>
<p>Chittenden, a bank holding company based in Burlington, Vt., reported assets of $2.0 billion on December 31,1996.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
